{"articleNo":"127924","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=127924&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015년도 사랑드림장학사업(삼성) 선발 완료 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.04.22","hit":"4049","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2015년 사랑드림장학사업(삼성) 장학생 추천이 완료되었음을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">* 선발인원 개별 문자 발송 </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 선발 인원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 주거안정 지원유형(기숙사 포함) : 7명</span></p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; * 사회적 배려계층 지원유형 신청자 없음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 지원내용</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-&nbsp;학기당 120만원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 계속지원기준 : 평점 2.6또는 백분위점수 100점 만점의 30점이상</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 직전학기 12학점 이상</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t